# Total cloud cover (%) — white veil that thickens with coverage.
# Transparent when clear so the base map stays readable. Rendered with
# interpolate_color (coverage is a continuous field, not a threshold-read
# parameter — hard bins would just look like banding).
nv    0   0   0   0
5     255 255 255 0
20    250 250 252 60
40    248 248 250 110
60    246 246 250 160
80    245 245 250 205
100   244 244 250 245
